1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,040
 [BLANK_AUDIO]

2
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:16,640
 These one leg duck squats will [BLEEP] your ass up in the best possible way.

3
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:20,320
 Seriously, they have become one of my favorite lower body exercises.

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:24,080
 First of all, they're one of the best glute builders I have done.

5
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:28,720
 Every client of mine that has done these has texted me the following day asking

6
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:32,960
 why their ass was so sore, and they light up your quads too.

7
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:35,600
 They're also incredibly joint friendly.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:40,640
 The duck stance enables you to squat very deep while maintaining an upright torso.

9
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:44,720
 So it's much more low back friendly compared to most squat variations.

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,600
 Another huge advantage is the loadability.

11
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:52,240
 Instead of being limited to one dumbbell like a goblet squat, you're holding two.

12
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:55,280
 So we have more strength and muscle building potential.

13
00:00:55,280 --> 00:01:00,320
 And because you're training one leg at a time, they help improve left to right imbalances.

14
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,080
 Two quick coaching cues.

15
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:06,800
 Make sure you turn the back foot out like a duck and stay up on your toes.

16
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,480
 And notice my grip.

17
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:14,080
 The dumbbell of the front leg stays at my side while the other one is held in front of my body.

18
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,840
 I call it the L grip.

19
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:19,760
 It feels way more natural and prevents the dumbbells from hitting your legs.

20
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:24,480
 FYI, these are one of the signature exercises in my new Lean Bastard program,

21
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,160
 which drops in August.

22
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:30,960
 But if you want early access, comment Lean and I'll send you the link to join the VIP list.

23
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:34,560
 These one leg duck squats will f***.

